# STEP 1 - Solid shell.
# One big solid box of deepslate bricks. Rooms are carved out of it
# in step 2. Doing it this way guarantees every room has sealed walls
# (no water / lava / cave leaks), which is what usually ruins a build.
#
# Box: X -14..14, Y -21..-13, Z 3..28  = 6786 blocks (fill limit is 32768)

fill ~-14 ~-21 ~3 ~14 ~-13 ~28 deepslate_bricks
